### Gradle template
.gradle
.kotlin/

# Note that you may need to exclude by hand other folders
# named build if necessary (e.g., in src/)
**/build/

# Avoid ignoring Gradle wrapper jar file (.jar files are usually ignored)
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# Cache of project
.gradletasknamecache

### Field document side-artefacts, anywhere in the tree
# Opening a Field document writes into the directory it came from. `SavingContext.save`
# fans out to seven producers (saving.kt:444-521), and the five below are all derived from
# the two files a document actually is (`metadata.edn` and `document.md`). Committed demo
# documents live inside this repository — `dev_docs/agents/demos/`, `public/docs/assets/` —
# so opening one used to leave four untracked paths in `git status`.
#
**/backups/
**/history_metrics.edn
**/transcript.edn
**/operations.yaml
**/history_screenshots/

