### Local scratch/debug directory
tmp/

# Dear ImGui window state. Field never writes this — ImGuiRenderToTexture.kt sets
# io.iniFilename to null — but tools that render their own ImGui overlay into our process
# (NVIDIA Nsight) do, at the working directory. Root-anchored: it is only ever litter here.
/imgui.ini

### Field template backup snapshots
# Two spellings, both real. safeSave writes into `backups` (saving.kt,
# `File(file.parentFile, "backups")`), which the tree-wide `**/backups/` rule above
# already covers. `backup/` is the older spelling and is NOT empty: dropping it
# uncovered 1 003 files across templates/advanced_remote/backup (783) and
# templates/remote/backup (220), measured 2026-09-05 when exactly that happened.
templates/*/backup/
templates/*/backups/

### Test files
test_kdoc_*.kt
test_kdoc_*.kts

### Personal workspace files
src/personal/
field-user-dir/

### Electron wrapper
electron/node_modules/

### Field local HTTPS cert generated by Gradle task
config/field4-local.p12

### Nightly self-improvement scratch (per-branch build artifacts; never belong on main)
# Each nightly build branch writes a root worklog; the flatten in `git pull --rebase`
# would otherwise drag it onto main. Root-anchored so it only affects the repo root.
/NIGHTLY_WORKLOG.md

# The block that used to live here ignored jvmTest's "proof" artifacts at the repo root
# (/*-proof.svg, /sparkline-proof/, /spectral_*_spectrogram.png, fn_fit_montage.png) and said:
# "The real fix is for these tests to render to a temp dir; until then, root-anchored ignores."
# That fix has now landed — see `afield.proofDir` in src/jvmTest/kotlin/afield/TestProofDir.kt —
# so the ignores are gone with the litter they were hiding. Set AFIELD_PROOF_DIR to collect the
# artifacts somewhere deliberate.

# Agent scratch and in-progress demo verification, not part of the demo corpus (2026-09-25).
# `test_demo_build_scripts` and `AgentDemoRegistrationTest` enumerate this directory from the
# filesystem, so an untracked folder here reads as an undeclared demo.
dev_docs/agents/demos/.agent-scratch/
dev_docs/agents/demos/ai4_loop_verification/

# Excalidraw bundle build inputs (output is committed under src/jsMain/resources/excalidraw/)
tools/excalidraw-bundle/node_modules/
tools/mermaid-bundle/node_modules/
tools/katex-bundle/node_modules/

# Nightly agents' per-tree scratch (downloads, build logs); never source.
.nightly-tmp/

# A worktree a person needs: tools/reap_merged_worktrees.py never removes or cleans it.
.reaper-keep

# Migrated Kotlin package directories are source, not build output.
!src/jvmMain/kotlin/afield/study/build/
!src/jvmMain/kotlin/afield/study/build/*.kt
!src/jvmTest/kotlin/afield/study/build/
!src/jvmTest/kotlin/afield/study/build/*.kt

# The fixer bench rebuilds each brief from the fixup commit; keep only what AI4 produced.
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/*/prompt.md
# These four cases fixed the personal-boundary guard itself; their diffs quote private paths and
# fixture packages, which PersonalBoundaryTest rightly refuses in tracked files.
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/023343117-land/fix.diff
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/023343117/fix.diff
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/040682d0f-after1/fix.diff
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/040682d0f-after2/fix.diff
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/040682d0f-after3/fix.diff
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/040682d0f-land/fix.diff
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/36addffcd-land/fix.diff
dev_docs/ai/ai4_fixer_runs/bench/36addffcd/fix.diff
